   }
} 
return false;


Approach 2 : Optimal - O(N) USING HASHSET

HashSet<Integer> s = new HashSet<>();
for(int i : nums){
  if(!s.add(i){
    return true;
  }
)
return false ;

s.add returns true if the element is successfully added (means that the element does not exists in the set before)
